k:Tablespoon|tablespoons]] [[Cookbook:Ricotta|ricotta cheese]]\n*1 tablespoon granulated white [[Cookbook:sugar|sugar]]\n*1 tablespoon [[Cookbook:Whipped Cream|whipped cream]]\n*1 tablespoon [[Cookbook:Chocolate Chips|chocolate chips]]\n*½ tablespoon [[Cookbook:icing|icing]]\n\n==Procedure==\n#Prepare the cannoli shells if you are making them yourself.\n#Combine the ricotta and sugar. [[Cookbook:Folding|Fold]] in the whipped cream and chocolate chips.\n#Fill shells with the ricotta mixture. A [[Cookbook:Pastry Bag|piping bag]] works well here.\n#Cool cannoli in the fridge before serving.\n\n== Notes, tips, and variations ==\n\n* Replace the chocolate chips with dried fruit.\n\n[[Category:Italian recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for dessert]]\n[[Category:Recipes for pastries]]\n[[Category:Deep fried recipes]]\n[[Category:Refrigerated recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes with images]]\n[[Category:Recipes using whipped cream]]\n[[Category:Recipes using granulated sugar]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Cannoli","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"Cannoli shells (store-bought or homemade)","sourceText":"Cannoli shells (store-bought or homemade)","amountText":"Cannoli shells (store-bought or homemade)","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"2 tablespoons ricotta cheese","sourceText":"2 tablespoons ricotta cheese","amountText":"2 tablespoons ricotta cheese","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 tablespoon granulated white sugar","sourceText":"1 tablespoon granulated white sugar","amountText":"1 tablespoon granulated white sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 tablespoon whipped cream","sourceText":"1 tablespoon whipped cream","amountText":"1 tablespoon whipped cream","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"1 tablespoon chocolate chips","sourceText":"1 tables